window.products.push({"id":870067,"name":"Rabbit Wine and Beverage Bottle Stoppers with Grip Top (Assorted Colors, Set of 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711OVsL9UlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add some fun to your fridge or countertop Rabbit Wine/Beverage Bottle Stoppers What better way to unwind after a long day at the office than enjoying a nice glass of wine? But then you are left with the rest of the bottle and wondering, how do you preserve that freshness? Our soft, cushy wine bottle stoppers provide an air-tight seal that are perfect for sealing wine. EASE OF USE Part of the Preserve line, the Rabbit Bottle Stoppers are not just for sealing wine. They are made of rubber and stainless steel so their soft texture allows them to provide an air-tight seal in all bottle sizes including wine, champagne, soda, and oil and vinegar. Clean up is easy – these bottle stoppers are dishwasher safe and reusable. WHAT YOU GET You will receive an assortment of four bright, fun colored wine stoppers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711OVsL9UlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rabbit","source_asin":"B06Y2J84MY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y2J84MY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y2J84MY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":870068,"name":"LIANLAM 1000 Thread Count Cotton Queen Size Sheets Set, Smooth Luxury Egyptian 100% Cotton Sheets - 4 Piece, Cool Breathable Bed Sheets ,16\" Elasticiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+yAay-foL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"100% PURE COTTON FOR PREMIUM COMFORT & SOFTNESS: Experience the luxury and silky-soft feel brought together by 1000 threads woven per square inch with our premium Egyptian cotton like sheets. These 1000 thread count sheet sets are the perfect blend of breathability and durability, making them the ideal remedy for night sweats. 100% natural long staple cotton yarns are woven together using sateen weave to give you the ideal comfort and smoothness of 5-star hotel bedding. CERTIFIED GREEN WEAVING & DYEING: All our dyes, auxiliaries, and our sheets are OEKOTEX and GOTS certified to ensure your safety. LIANLAM sheets maintain sustainable & chemical-free. These ultra soft cotton cooling sheets are extremely safe for your health (and for our ocean too!). SNUG FIT:Looking for a fitted sheet in the 4-piece set that actually stays in its place and doesn't come off? Our fitted sheet comes with an all-around elastic to fit your mattress perfectly. The head/foot side indicator tells you how to make the bed easily. WHAT'S INCLUDE: Each Queen Size Sheet Set comes with 1× Fitted Sheet 60\"×80\"×16\" + 1× Flat Sheet 90\"×102\"+2× Pillowcases 20\"×30\". Care Guidance: Machine wash our 100% cotton queen size sheets in warm water and tumble dry on low heat, do not bleach. When machine drying, do not dry at high temperatures.LIANLAM cotton bed sheets will not fade, even after many machine washes. Pill-Proof & Odor-Free! Cotton tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a couple washes to experience their silky softness. YOUR SATISFACTION IS IMPORTANT TO US: Along with superior comfort and luxury, our products also come with incredible customer service and 100% satisfaction guarantee. If you encounter any problems, you can contact us.Gift them to your loved ones and family or simply add them to your stunning room decor and enjoy bespoke californian luxury with our high quality sheets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+yAay-foL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIANLAM","source_asin":"B0B1HX4J9D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1HX4J9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1HX4J9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
