window.products.push({"id":870208,"name":"Angry Birds Star Wars Edible Image Cake Topper Frosting Sheet-7.5\"x10\"(1/4 sheet)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x6XkFrH9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Edible icing art is a great way to make a cake and cupcakes look fantastic and professional. These are an easy and inexpensive way to make your cake look like a masterpiece. All icing images come with instructions . Simply remove the edible icing art from backing and place on top of freshly iced cake or cupcakes. After 15 to 25 minutes the edible icing art will blend with the frosting to give your cake a professional look. Prints are professionally printed on compressed icing sheets. Easy to Use; Instructions on How to Apply Topper Included Gluten-Free, Dairy-Free, Kosher Certified, No Allergens Edible Image Icing Cake Topper Ingredients: Water, Cornstarch, Corn Syrup Solids, Cellulose, Sorbotol, Glycerine, Sugar, Vegetable Oil, Arabic Gum, Polysorbate 80, Vanilla, Titanium Dioxide, Citric Acid. You will receive this image exactly as pictured (cake not included). Msg us at the time of purchase and we will place a birthday greeting on it at no additional charge. Please tell us the color you wish the greeting in or we will use black.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x6XkFrH9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cake&Deco","source_asin":"B01ES3RG0Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ES3RG0Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ES3RG0Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":870209,"name":"Aston & Arden Linen Eucalyptus Sheet Set - Classic and Sustainable Moisture Wicking Lyocell Tencel Bed Sheets for a Cooling, Soft, Breathable, and Com","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bHfCefnAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CLASSIC LINEN LOOK: Linen's classic texture is soft and welcoming to the touch, while Tencel offers superior draping qualities making this sheet smooth and sleek on your bed. This luxury sheet set is made from a unique yarn blend of eucalyptus lyocell and traditional linen. Eucalyptus lyocell, known as Tencel, is derived from sustainable eucalyptus wood pulp that makes exceptionally soft and silky yarns. ADVANCED PERFORMANCE: Enjoy the traditional look of linen and the advanced technological benefits of this performance fabric. Both linen and Tencel lyocell contain naturally cooling properties. Linen's lightweight, breathable fibers wick moisture away from the body, where it is absorbed and dispersed by the open-weave construction. Make a classic decor choice with modern linen Tencel blend sheets. CALMING COLOR PALETTE: We chose a soft subtle color palette for our linen and eucalyptus lyocell sheet sets. Linen and lyocell sheets are available in latte cream, wheat bbeige, icy grey, and powder white. Four-piece sheet sets are available in California king, king, queen, and full sizes. CURL UP IN COMFORT: Slip into sheets so comfy you'll want to stay in bed all day. Linen is anti-static, which helps skin retain its natural pH levels. From its ventilating, moisture-absorbing, and evaporating capabilities, this 40% linen / 60% lyocell blend fabric is perfect for those with sensitive skin. Smart performance sheet sets for the whole family. ENVIRONMENTALLY RESPONSIBLE BEDDING: Enjoy peace of mind knowing that Tencel sheet sets are produced by environmentally responsible processes from the sustainably sourced natural eucalyptus wood that safeguards resources for future generations. Tencel is on track for net-zero emissions by 2050, prioritizing the continuous reduction of carbon emissions through efficient production, new technologies, and renewable energy sources.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bHfCefnAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aston & Arden","source_asin":"B0BMWFST1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMWFST1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMWFST1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
