window.products.push({"id":870272,"name":"Paper Towel Holder - Under Cabinet Paper Towel Rack Self Adhesive Paper Towel Bar for Kitchen, SUS304 Stainless Steel Wall Mount Kitchen Paper Holder ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jAWR5Ht5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Two Installation Methods - Paste or Drilling】 Just peel off the film of the adhesive pad and stick it on the smooth wall surface, Press 20 seconds to remove the air, and wait 24 hours before using. Or you also can drill the hole on any surface to install with the screw. 【High-Quality Material】The under cabinet paper towel holder is made of waterproof SUS 304 stainless steel, rustproof, anti-oxidation, and corrosion resistance. A durable and fashionable round holder that can match your kitchen/bathroom perfectly. 【Save More Space】The under cabinet paper towel holder will help you clear the clutter that was all over the counter and perfect for saving space in a tiny kitchen. The Paper towel holder's length is 13.2 inch that accommodates most standard and jumbo-sized rolls. 【Multiple Installation Options】Vertical or horizontal (left or right), paper towel roll holder is ideal for installation on the side of a sink or cabinet (on a cabinet door, under-cabinet), which is the ideal accessories to replace the countertop holder and perfectly save the counter space. 【Applicable Surfaces for Adhesive】Must be smooth surfaces such as wooden, ceramic tiles, marble stone, metal, glass, etc. (Not suitable for limestone wall, wallpaper or painted wall or uneven surfaces.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jAWR5Ht5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DNou","source_asin":"B0936ZVMLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0936ZVMLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0936ZVMLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":870273,"name":"Lodge 12-Inch Square Breakfast Griddle with Assist Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31MY04VZ3WL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description popular Square Cast Iron Griddle 3/4-inch deep sides makes it ideal for cooking bacon, eggs, sausage, hash browns, French toast and pancakes Amazon.com Chefs will tell you what your grandmother already knew: nothing beats cast-iron cookware for durability, conductivity, even heat distribution, and value. Season cast iron properly and foods won't stick either--no need for a synthetic nonstick coating that might peel or crack. Cast iron even adds iron to the nutritional content of a meal, just like your grandmother said. Made by Lodge, one of the oldest and most trusted names in cast-iron cookware, this 12-inch square griddle is the ideal size for frying up a whole pound of bacon at once--or griddling eggs, sausage, square-sided pancakes, even sautéing the kinds of things you don't eat for breakfast. There's an extra handle on one side to help you lift the griddle and its contents--pretty handy when dealing with a pan as heavy as this one. Be sure not to use dishwashing liquid on seasoned cast iron, and towel dry and coat with a light layer of oil after washing. Never leave cast iron sitting in water, because it will rust. If you treat cast-iron cookware properly, your own grandchildren will still be using it when that fancy aluminum-alloy pan is long gone to the great yuppie kitchen in the sky. --Mary Park","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31MY04VZ3WL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B00005LVUW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005LVUW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005LVUW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":870274,"name":"Grelucgo Small Short Handmade Hemstitch Spring Green Table Runner Dresser Scarf, Rectangular 14 by 48 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HO3aoeRvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for something simple yet pretty, this will do that all! It is made of nice weight and good material. Choose the right size to décor your nightstand, dressers, servers and tables!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HO3aoeRvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grelucgo","source_asin":"B07B21KM2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B21KM2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B21KM2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":870275,"name":"nuLOOM Leora Contemporary Area Rug, 8' x 10', Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91arhi8D8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At nuLOOM, we believe that floor coverings and art should not be mutually exclusive. Founded with a desire to break the rules of what is expected from an area rug, nuLOOM was created to fill the void between brilliant design and affordability, The images we display have the most accurate colors possible.Rug Colors, sizes, patterns may vary slightly depending on how your rug is made and the size ordered.Due to different monitor resolutions and lighting you may notice a slight difference in color. Each handmade rug is unique to the artisan who weaved it.These are not considered defects Bunching, Creases and Folded Corners: You may see some creases and bunching in the pile and around the corners when you unroll your new rug. These waves will flatten within 2 -3 weeks as you begin to use your new rug. Use these tricks to help flatten your rug: Back Rolling: Roll the carpet out, then roll it back up reversely with the backside up. Let it sit rolled up reversely for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. Heavy Objects: Lay a piece of heavy furniture or objects on affected areas for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. If the corners are sticking up, curl them back and place heavy objects on affected areas going the opposite way. Heat: Use this technique as a last resort only. Place the rug over a cleared concrete or area like a driveway or sidewalk setting during dry sunny conditions. Allow the rug to be positioned for optimal sunlight as long as possible to give the rug time to absorb the sun's heat for up to 2 hours, but use more time if needed. Blow Dryer: If a large concrete patch with optimal sunlight is not accessible, flip the rug over and use a hair dryer to affected areas to heat up the creases. Always hold the hair dryer 7 to 12 inches away from the rug going side to side on a medium setting, as heat can sometimes cause backing to melt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91arhi8D8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nuLOOM","source_asin":"B0C2CH1PGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2CH1PGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2CH1PGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
