window.products.push({"id":870320,"name":"Dos Damas Designs Mission Church Copper Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eQhCi2A-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dos Damas Designs is a family-run business based in Arizona, and each piece is handcrafted in The Copper State. Inherent ingredients in the copper, verdigris application techniques and desert weather all play a part in creating the unique patina of each ornament. Artistically manipulated bends and creases bring the designs to life. Use your imagination to display them year-round. Hang them on a window with a mini suction cup, or drape one over the neck of a wine bottle. Try them as a gift wrap embellishment for a special present or as a napkin ring accent at dinner. The possibilities are endless.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eQhCi2A-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dos Damas Designs","source_asin":"B019DD2AKC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019DD2AKC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019DD2AKC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":870321,"name":"YUNLIGHTS Christmas Tree Topper Decoration - Christmas Tree Decoration Lighted Snowflake with 10 Colorful Lighting Modes 2-in-1 Christmas Ornaments fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7115HBafC2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄【10 COLOFUL & GLITTERY LIGHTING MODES】-- Different to other LED Christmas tree decorations, plenty of colors and 10 automatic colorful lighting mode are integrated into our Christmas tree ornament lighted. Thus it looks like a star is as glittery and elegant as a star of Bethlehem that guided the wise men. Let it provides a brilliant finishing touch to your holiday display! 🎄【2-IN-1 CHRISTMAS TREE TOPPER FOR TREE & WALL】-- Upgrades to its installation method, the lighted Christmas tree decoration is equipped with flush mounting design at the back, unlike others. Thus this white Christmas tree decoration can apply to wall, Christmas tree, desk, and so on, perfect for spreading holiday spirit and bring good luck to whole family. 🎄【PERFECT SNOWFALKE TREE TOPPER FOR INOOR CHRISTMAS DECORATION】-- With glitter powder on the surface, the led Christmas tree ornament will glaring and attractive, bringing your party, wedding, Christmas, New Year, festival with unforgettable decoration and making all of you impressed. The dreamy snowflake shaped decor creates a romantic Christmas atmosphere and is sure to look charmingly elegant year after year. 🎄【STURDY & SHATTER RESISTANT ON CHRISTMAS TREE】-- Equipped with one spiral stand for the topper and made from hard plastic, the white tree decoration is not only actually shatter-resistant that stays securely in place on top of the tree where it belongs, but also is less liable to break or damage, and suitable for being used over and over again. Our Christmas tree topper is shiny and eye-catching that makes your Christmas unique and attractive. 🎄【EASY TO DECORATE ON YOUR CHRISTMAS】-- Two installation methods for this Christmas tree topper ornaments. On the one hand, attach it to the tree—you simply place the spiral base on the top of the tree(Be mindful to push it all the way down). On the other hand, mount it on the wall—you simply lock its back with its mounting design on the wall. It is easy to decorate Christmas tree, door, home, store, office, hotel and restaurant, bar and any other places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7115HBafC2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YUNLIGHTS","source_asin":"B08HSZC37T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HSZC37T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HSZC37T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
