window.products.push({"id":870465,"name":"Soldow Led Mirror for Bathroom Anti-Fog & Waterproof 32x24 Inch, Lighted Vanity Mirror for Bathroom Wall, Backlit Mirror with Lights Dimmable 3-Color ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"【HIGH QUALITY LED MIRROR】- Compared to other conventional mirrors, Soldow 5mm copper free silver mirror will give you more clarity and perfect color rendering (CRI > 95). Bluit-in led safe and durable with lifespan over 50,000 hours, can be used as auxiliary lighting or ambient lighting. 【DEFOG & WATERPROOF】Soldow backlit bathroom mirror feature anti-fogging function that keeps clear reflection image. Defog button is seperated controled from light switch, safe and energy-saving. IP54 level waterproof and moisture-proof backing ensures safe lighting over over a sink or in wet bathroom environments. 【SMART TOUCH】Minimalist design of two buttons only: FOG FREE and LIGHT ADJUSTABLE. Simply touch to switch color temperatures (3000K-6000K), and long press to dim brightness stepless (10%-100%). 【MEMORY FUNCTION】Smart remembrance function can remember your last settings. The light will return to the last use when the LED mirror is restarted after a power failure. 【HORIZONTAL/VERTICAL INSTALLATION】- Soldow led bathroom mirror comes with wall mounting kit, which can be easily installed horizontal/vertical in 5-10 minutes. 【PLUG OR WALL SWITCH】- Support wall switch control and can be connected using plugs or hardwired, suitable for bathroom, doorway, dressing room etc. 【3 YEARS WARRANTY】- Full refund or free replacements for led mirrors damaged on arrival, what you need to do is sending us some pictures. We are constantly improving the craftsmanship and packaging of our mirrors to ensure that our mirrors reach our customers intact. Please don't hesitate to contact us if there's anything we can help with you. 【PACKAGE CONTENT】- 1X LED Mirror, 1X Mounting Kit, 1X Instruction, 1X 3-year warranty. Our packaging passed various tests including dropping test, impact test, heavy pressure test etc, to reduce damage during transportation. Power supply and LED lights are UL listed with more than 50,000 hours lifespan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soldow","source_asin":"B08QMZ2KM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QMZ2KM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QMZ2KM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
