window.products.push({"id":870649,"name":"GOFLAME 48\" Pre-lit Artificial Christmas Wreath, Green Christmas Wreath w/ 200 Warm LED Lights, 714 Tips, 100% New PVC Material, 2 Timers, Indoor Outd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UsbP2kaHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Ultra Large Size for Eye-catching Decoration: Measuring 48 inch in diameter, the Christmas wreath is supposed to be an attractive Christmas decoration wherever you hang it. House beam, front door, fireplace and more places decorated with wreath will make a big change. After all, plentiful branch tips create a lush design while the pure green color brings the vitality. Warm White LED Lights with Timing Function: There are 200 pre-strung LED lights, of which warm white lighting effect fills your house with Christmas cheering. It also comes with 2 timers that feature 6-hour on and 18-hour off function to help you control the lighting time based on individual requirement. Premium Material for Lasting Durability: Needless to say, the finer the material is chosen, the better. Taking the using safety into consideration, the wreath uses 100% new PVC material. It is odorless and non flammable. In this way, you don’t need to endure the unpleasant smell caused by inferior recycled material any more. Moreover, it also ensures longer service time. Enjoy Christmas with Good Blessing: As an indispensible decoration in the most important festive, the Christmas wreath is endowed with multiple meanings in different cultures. Anyway, we wish you can feel the festival jollification and reap a harvest of blessing when you hang this green wreath during Christmas. Quick Assembly & Solid Connection: The assembly is required. However, it only takes a moment to connect the 2 pieces into a complete wreath using the screws provided. The metal ring as the base of wreath is capable of strengthening its sturdiness to make it not easy to deform, and thus keep a perfect shape in the long term.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UsbP2kaHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOFLAME","source_asin":"B08M62G2LK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M62G2LK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M62G2LK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
