window.products.push({"id":870678,"name":"ORIENT All Season Queen Size 350 GSM Bed Comforter -Quilted Comforter - Duvet Insert - Down Alternative Comforter with Corner Tabs (90x90 Inches, Whit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UU61jZchL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester Fabric - 100% Microfiber Polyester fabric is very comfortable, very soft and noise free, more breathable, durable and odor free. Premium Filling - 7D siliconized fiberfill is extremely soft material that provides a comfy and cozy feel. Corner Tabs - 8 Durable Tabs on 4 Corners and 4 Sides. With the help of corner loops it can be adjusted easily to put on any duvet cover and secures the comforter in place. Quilting Technology - Made with advanced stitching technology to keep the filling in place, the 12 inch*12 inch quilted lattice keeps your quilt in place and never slips out. Easy Care - Washes in cold water, does not fade, does not shrink, does not tear, does not clump, does not leak after washing, tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UU61jZchL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORIENT","source_asin":"B0BJV6DKPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJV6DKPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJV6DKPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":870679,"name":"Chihee Oil Sprayer for Cooking Olive Oil Sprayer Mister 200 ml /6.8 oz Glass Oil Dispenser Bottle Gourd-shaped,Easy to Grip,Stable Placed,For Salad/Ki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b9bB5epjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Benefits.This 6.8 oz single action pump sprayer is chic, simple, and perfect for anyone hoping to avoid the undersized push buttons utilized.The comfortable trigger button encompasses the entire top of the bottle and is grooved for no-slip operation. With the wide mist spray, you can easily coat a large frying pan in seconds without stressing your hand or wasting time pumping.Use it for other liquid seasonings like vinegar, soy sauce, lemon/lime juice, sherry or wine. Fewer Calories & Precise Portion Control.Because you can cover a large surface area with far less oil, these sprayers are perfect for anyone hoping to cut down on the amount of fat and calories in their diet. The spray comes out in a fine mist, which will allow you to cover more of your pan or food with far less oil.The bottles are transparent, so you can see how much liquid is left.making this the perfect option for anyone looking to apply just the right amount of oil & vinegar to salads. Chic and convenient.This pressurized oil sprayer has a simple design and look.If you are hunting for an olive oil sprayer that looks as good as it functions,you are found this 6.8 oz single pump sprayer.The rounded glass bottle tucks nicely into a stylish stainless steel cap that disguises the spray nozzle. Just press the smooth,oversized push button on the top of the cap to release a generous mist onto prepared meals and salads.The kit comes with a small funnel for no-mess refilling. Healthy & Eco-Friendly.When you hear “oil sprayer” what’s the first thing you think of? For many,what comes to mind is a metal aerosol can of vegetable oil.But glass is always an earth-friendly choice and great for oils since it doesn’t leach or absorb,it’s best for your oil to keep them locked away in a dark pantry.Sprayers that are well-made and easy to clean can also be reused over and over,making them a far better choice for the planet. Satisfaction guarantee.No risk shopping.You will receive 1 sprayer and 1 funnel,they are packed in an exquisite box.If you have any questions about the product or service, please contact us, we will be happy to solve the problem for you.Customer satisfaction is always our priority.Any issues of our products,contact us in time,we will help as soon as possible.In case of defects or damage,providing new replacements is our most basic service content.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b9bB5epjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chihee","source_asin":"B093SQXKBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093SQXKBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093SQXKBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
