window.products.push({"id":870711,"name":"Dutsekk 24 x 32 Inch LED Vanity Bathroom Mirror Anti-Fog Dimmable IP44 Waterproof, LED Lighted Bathroom Mirror Wall Mounted with Touch Switch Control,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ql1ATECaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose Dutsekk? Dustekk is committed to creating modern and high-quality sanitary ware for consumers. Under the premise of ensuring the quality of products, we constantly innovate and improve, pursue simplicity and practicality, combine modern elements, improve the quality of life and experience the fun of life for our customers. Product Features: 1. Touch Switch Control -- The Dutsekk 24 x 32 Inch LED Vanity Bathroom Mirror has two touch buttons, the on/off button and the anti-fog button, which can light up the light and turn on the anti-fog function with just a short touch. 2. Dimmable & 3 Light Modes -- You can long press the on/off button to select the desired brightness from 10% to 100%. And it has 3 light color modes(warm/natural/cold light), short press the on/off button to choose the color you need for makeup, style hair, and brushing teeth.3. No Flicker -- The CRI90+ LED strip is wound around all flanks of the mirror, and light concentrates to release from frosted areas, brings super bright illumination without a flicker in your bathroom. Make you see your truest reflection.4. Safe & Energy-saving -- Equipped with UL certified driver, all components comply with US electrical safety standards. And our LED vanity bathroom mirror is environmentally friendly and has adopted energy-saving technology. Mirror Specifications: CRI>90Power:30WShape: RectangleWaterproof: IP44 waterproofMaterial: Aluminium&Glass&PVCPower Source: Input 100-240VColor Temperature: 3000k-6000kSize: 32x24x1.38 InchMirror Thickness: 1.38 inchWire Length: 11 inchMirror Weight:18.34lbs.Installation: hang horizontally or vertically, hard-wire Package Included: 1* Dutsekk 24x32 Inch LED Vanity Bathroom MirrorInstallation Accessories:4* Screws4* Wall Anchors1* Mini Level1* Wire Connector1* Working Gloves1* User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ql1ATECaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dutsekk","source_asin":"B08GFMSHGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GFMSHGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GFMSHGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
