window.products.push({"id":870736,"name":"Universal Bedlegs 5\" 2Pc Plastic Screw-In Legs Set of 6, Sand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CdY0rrihL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5\" is highly popular for people with high profile mattresses. Our 5\" bed leg system lowers your bed and at the same time still provides a good size storage under your bed. A lower bed makes it easier to get on and off the bed for shorter people, including small children, and those with mobility issues like the elderly and injured people who may be recovering. Choose a short bed leg if your mattress is thick and the bed has become inconveniently tall. Better than metal bed frames, our bed leg system is extremely durable, strong and will not wobble. Each leg can withstand up to 2000 lbs of direct weight without breaking. Our bed legs system can easily support and evenly distributes the entire weight of your bed on the floor surface. With proper support, your mattress will last longer and your sleep quality will improve. Our bed legs are ideal to use around toddlers and babies and those who are blind or visually impaired. Their compact size and light weight make them ideal for rooms that are tight or hard to reach like in the attic or upstairs. Installation is simple: use a screw driver to attach the base plate onto your box spring and screw the threaded leg stem into the base plate. To adjust your bed height, simply unscrew the leg stem and replace it with a different size Universal Bedleg leg stem. When deciding on the leg height, measure from the bottom of your box spring to the mattress surface (including any mattress covers, pads, and toppers) and subtract that number from the desired height of the mattress from the floor. Consider the drop length of your bed skirt and your headboard size and style before finalizing your decision. Base Plate: 4 3/8\" x 2 7/8\"; Bottom Base: 2 3/4\" dia; Installed Height: 5\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CdY0rrihL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Universal Bedlegs Inc.","source_asin":"B01C2OF61E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C2OF61E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C2OF61E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":870737,"name":"Texology Luxury Bath Towels Set of 8, Quick-Dry Textured, Includes 2 Bath Towels for Bathroom, 2 Hand Towels, 4 Washcloths, Super-Absorbent-Oeko-Tex C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u08jxEMFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Promising Quality With Premium Luxury: 100% combed, ring spun cotton is chosen to produce extravagant and durable, bathroom towels. The Pure Luxury 8-piece durable bath towel set is made of finest quality. Our Large bath towels set is lightweight, quick dry. And the pure cotton fabric is resistant to wear while remaining soft. Plush grey bath towels set provides a luxurious bathroom design to enhance your bathing decor. Perfect 8 Piece Towel Set: Our plush towel set includes 2 piece bath towels measuring 27 x 54 inches, 2 piece hand towels measuring 16 x 28 inches, and 4 piece washcloths 12 x 12 inches. 600 GSM for thicker, heavier feel and excellent absorbency. Better Water Absorbent and Quick Drying: Our Premium cotton Bath towels are highly absorbent yet lightweight, crafted specifically to dry off really fast providing maximum efficiency. The absorbent nature of these Shower towels, give your skin a soft and delicate touch. The double-stitched hem and natural weave guarantees its durability and strength. Useful And Long Lasting: Enjoy the ensuing softness, absorbency, plush, luxurious, tightly woven big towel sets for bathroom that can quickly wick moisture from your body. Perfect for poolside, bath, Spa, beach, salon, gym, hospital towels, kitchen and room essentials. Its Soft, super absorbent, nature is ideal for every age and everyday usage. Easy To Care: The bath shower towels, are extremely easy to wash and reuse. These towel sets are specially processed to make the dryer take less time, thus saving time and energy costs. Its machine washable, we recommend washing in cold water before your first use, to improve the absorbency. Tumble dry on low heat or hang them to dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u08jxEMFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Texology","source_asin":"B09GV9TZNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GV9TZNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GV9TZNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
