window.products.push({"id":870976,"name":"Barcalounger Affinity II Recliner - Remy Chocolate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":999.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713SONDSwBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A blend of unique styling, design and head to toe comfort is presented with the Affinity II. The pillow top arm, continuous chaise seat and plush divided back adds up to wrap around comfort. The Casual Comfort series features designs suitable for transitional or traditional decor with large cushions for extra comfort and stability. Each recliner in this series is a typical recliner design, and requires 8-12 inches of wall clearance for full extension and supreme lounging comfort. These chairs would make a perfect addition to any media or entertainment room. In the history of superior reclining furniture, Barcalounger has a storied reputation. In fact, they have been two steps ahead of the competition ever since the first Barcalounger's were produced in 1940 due to superior construction elements and the benefits they provide to the customer. Barcalounger engineers realize their products will probably receive more use than any other piece of upholstered furniture in the home, which is why they have set standards of quality and excellence that are higher and more demanding than most upholstery manufacturers. Features include hardwood plywood frames, with mortise & tenon construction, glued joints & corner blocks, mechanisms that are ACTIVATED, not operated and require only 2.5 lbs of pressure to release, mechanisms featuring delrin bushings wherever metal meets metal (ensuring seamless motion and no squeaking), high performance foam (which promotes stability, durability and longevity), higher than average stitch count per inch, reinforced seams with baseball stitch accents, padding all around the chair, upholstered handles (allowing the handle to disappear into the background cover), and fully upholstered underneath, a statement of high quality; above, and beyond, and even underneath!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713SONDSwBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Casual Comforts","source_asin":"B00HZTU4PK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HZTU4PK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HZTU4PK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
