window.products.push({"id":870994,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Parchment Paper Liner: 6.3 or 7.9 Inch 100PCS Round Unbleached Silicone Paper for 4QT to 10QT Airfryer Toaster Oven Basket (6.3In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aQMwL7upL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【KEEP YOUR AIR FRYER CLEAN】:These disposable paper liners 8-inch can effectively keep food residue away from fryer and make it as clean as unused.Just throw away the air fryer parchment paper liners after use. No need to clean the fryer anymore. These air paper liners are must have for baking and cooking. 【AIR FRYER BAKING LINERS】Baking paper using food grade parchment, it is waterproof, oil-proof, non-stick, nice heat resistant, can withstand temperatures up to 428 degrees Fahrenheit. It has no effect on the taste of food. [NOTE]:Do not put empty parchment paper liners when preheating, and do not use too little food to avoid disposable paper liners that cannot be pressed because of their light weight, and hot air blowing the paper liners into the heat pipe causing the paper pan to burn. 【FOR 5 to 8 QT ROUND BASKETS】Find out correct capacity of air fryer.Parchment paper of 7.9-inch bottom diameter is intended for Round air fryers whose basket capacity is between 5 and 8 quarts. Moreover, the disposable paper even fits microwaves, ovens, steamer, cookers, roasters, etc. 【SUFFCIENT QUANTITY】Including 16CM/6.3inch 100pcs parchment papers for baking, sufficient quantities offer a wide range of choices for your daily cooking, baking and replacement needs. Just throw away the air fryer parchment paper liners after use. No need to clean the fryer anymore. 【UNIQUE DESIGN】:These Air Fryer Parchment Paper Liners are designed with a rectangle bowl shape, which do not need to tear, fold, cut, nor bend, and you can directly put it in when you are ready to cook. Its heightened edge 4.3cm/1.7inch can protect the side of fryers from food residue can easy to take the food out with the heightened edge .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aQMwL7upL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOTTI VEN","source_asin":"B0BNMF5C3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-870994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNMF5C3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNMF5C3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
